    help: 'Example: Jane Doe is the Manager''s founder and chief investment officer. She previously spent ten years as a portfolio manager at a registered investment adviser.'
    default: '[Jane Doe is the Manager''s founder and chief investment officer. She previously spent ten years as a portfolio manager at a registered investment adviser.]'
    section: Management
  - name: strategy_specific_risks_description
